sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in words-v1, written in the token form: a template for word filters, and a check on the
; engine (it must judge exactly as words-v1 does, with the same dictionary).
id        words-data
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  Every token is a complete dictionary word (words-v1, as a plugin).
param     dictionary  dict  default  the word list (a registered dictionary)

tokens    separator " "
edges     whole
set       word  dict:{dictionary}
end
